r": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UiF7VjR6pSwuRw3H9Cqt2J", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 10336, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GBzQfKdhKcJtffRLiZifB4", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 10636, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GBzQfKdhKcJtffRLiZifB4", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10636, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GBzQfKdhKcJtffRLiZifB4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 13300, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RQPtbKX1THdTBgpUitp7T6", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 17300, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RQPtbKX1THdTBgpUitp7T6", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 17300, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RQPtbKX1THdTBgpUitp7T6", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19035, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01JNZ6KDWHwHaMnoZ7RLQxvP", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19335, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01JNZ6KDWHwHaMnoZ7RLQxvP", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19335, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JNZ6KDWHwHaMnoZ7RLQxvP", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 23983, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01YX3SUEtEtSgqpG83JAxyb3", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) after deploy, with an error rate of about 18%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt partially failed ('Rollout halted after us-east: orchestrator error'), which left the regions on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A retry finished the rollback in all regions. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (and why it went to production even though the RC was unhealthy in staging), and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54583, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01YX3SUEtEtSgqpG83JAxyb3", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54583, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YX3SUEtEtSgqpG83JAxyb3", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 56644, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0177NzVRETsBcAhS8MLZQLUo", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 56944, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0177NzVRETsBcAhS8MLZQLUo", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 56944, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0177NzVRETsBcAhS8MLZQLUo", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62404, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1, the current release, was unhealthy with an error rate of about 18%.\n- My first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after us-east. That left us-east on v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the same rollback again and it completed. All three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n- v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production, so this didn't need change-manager approval.\n\n**Incident**\n- I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api). The request to create it timed out, but the incident list shows it was created. I didn't retry, so there's only one incident and one page.\n- It covers what happened, the failed first attempt and the retry, the current state, and what needs following up.\n\n**Worth following up**\n- The v2.3.1 release candidate had also failed health checks in staging, but the release still went to production.\n- The orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback hasn't been explained.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014irZckdxL3b1aVHRtWQCeU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01B5K5WTYsjiQk9VjCc9MTrk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01UiF7VjR6pSwuRw3H9Cqt2J", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GBzQfKdhKcJtffRLiZifB4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east was rolled back before the orchestrator stopped. Rolling back to the same version again should be safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01RQPtbKX1THdTBgpUitp7T6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JNZ6KDWHwHaMnoZ7RLQxvP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01YX3SUEtEtSgqpG83JAxyb3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) after deploy, with an error rate of about 18%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt partially failed ('Rollout halted after us-east: orchestrator error'), which left the regions on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A retry finished the rollback in all regions. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate about 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (and why it went to production even though the RC was unhealthy in staging), and look into the orchestrator error during the rollback."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out, so I'll check whether the incident was created before trying again. That way I don't page twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0177NzVRETsBcAhS8MLZQLUo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1, the current release, was unhealthy with an error rate of about 18%.\n- My first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after us-east. That left us-east on v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west were still on v2.3.1.\n- I ran the same rollback again and it completed. All three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n- v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production, so this didn't need change-manager approval.\n\n**Incident**\n- I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api). The request to create it timed out, but the incident list shows it was created. I didn't retry, so there's only one incident and one page.\n- It covers what happened, the failed first attempt and the retry, the current state, and what needs following up.\n\n**Worth following up**\n- The v2.3.1 release candidate had also failed health checks in staging, but the release still went to production.\n- The orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback hasn't been explained.", "type": "text"}]}]}